WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.417 --> 00:00:02.585
I can’t wait to move into Gridiron Heights!

00:00:02.794 --> 00:00:05.630
You guys are all f--king mistakes.

00:00:05.922 --> 00:00:07.590
We’re here! Starters first!

00:00:10.927 --> 00:00:13.304
KNEEL BEFORE ME, ROOKIE SCUM!

00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:14.055
Nick! 

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:15.807
Buddy, you know I’m coming back.

00:00:15.807 --> 00:00:17.017
Ok, well, thanks, everyone. 

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:18.852
This was SO much fun while it lasted.

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:24.774
Gridiron Heights has never been stronger.

00:00:24.774 --> 00:00:26.609
Rebuilding is so fun.

00:00:26.609 --> 00:00:28.445
The Jets have been doing it for years!

00:00:28.445 --> 00:00:29.696
Helmet to helmet! 

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:31.156
Yeah, we’re not rebuilding.

00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:32.032
Yes you are.

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:34.993
I can clearly see you restructuring everything.

00:00:34.993 --> 00:00:36.036
Yeah, no. Nothing’s changed.

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:37.162
We’re still really good.

00:00:37.162 --> 00:00:38.997
Jimmy, are you going to help me?

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:41.041
Nah, just build around me.

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:43.501
Finally! Our rebuild is over.

00:00:43.501 --> 00:00:45.420
Hey! I’m not hurt this time!

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:46.963
Soon enough, Sammy.

00:00:47.172 --> 00:00:48.465
Just hit the nail, Hue.

00:00:48.465 --> 00:00:51.217
The nail may not get hammered....

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:54.179
...but Browns fans certainly will.

00:00:54.512 --> 00:00:56.222
The Patriots do not rebuild...

00:00:56.264 --> 00:00:58.016
We reload.

00:00:58.016 --> 00:01:00.018
Um, Coach, are we cool?

00:01:00.018 --> 00:01:00.685
No.

